				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-11T03:43:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>次は　絶対　負けないから！
先に　上に行くのは　わたしよ！▼　</Text>
