		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="INF_LOSE_MSG_TRID_309"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しょうぶの　あとは　かいふくコーナー
おたのしみにね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:42:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>勝負の後は　回復コーナー！
お楽しみにね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-14T03:43:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:21" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Comment>ナース 女 </Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-01T09:20:25" />
